@page
@model IndexModel
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Shared"; }

<h1>shared.md</h1>
<p class="muted">
    Write anything. Press Process when you are done — nothing happens until you do.
</p>

@* Quick-add, and first on the page on purpose: ADR 0009 makes it not optional
   because a thought captured standing in a doorway is the thing V0 is testing,
   and it must not cost more than one tap and one line. Its own form, so Enter
   inside it adds a line instead of pressing Process — which is the whole
   difference between a capture box and a nine-hundred-line textarea. *@

<form id="quick-add" method="post" hx-post="/?handler=QuickAdd"
      hx-target="#quick-add-state" hx-swap="innerHTML">
    <input type="text" name="Line" id="Line"
           placeholder="one thing, then Enter" autocomplete="off" />
    <button type="submit">Add</button>
    <span id="quick-add-state" class="muted"></span>
</form>

@* The textarea is the file, not a message box: it opens holding whatever the
   couple has written so far, and both partners are looking at the same text.
   Version travels with it so the server can tell a stale save from a current
   one; formaction states each button's handler, so which one was pressed is
   carried by the request rather than inferred from the payload. *@

<form method="post">
    <textarea name="Text" id="Text"
              placeholder="we're out of detergent and coffee&#10;dinner at Priya's parents on Saturday 8pm">@Model.Text</textarea>
    <input type="hidden" name="Version" id="Version" value="@Model.Version" />

    <p>
        <button type="submit" id="process" formaction="/?handler=Process"
                hx-post="/?handler=Process" hx-target="#report" hx-swap="innerHTML"
                hx-disabled-elt="#process, #save">Process</button>

        <button type="submit" id="save" formaction="/?handler=Save"
                hx-post="/?handler=Save" hx-target="#save-state" hx-swap="innerHTML"
                hx-disabled-elt="#process, #save">Save</button>

        <span class="muted htmx-indicator">thinking…</span>
    </p>
</form>

<div id="save-state" class="muted"></div>
<div id="report"></div>
